### Modification and source record

The upstream scanner's service-oriented assessment material was converted
into Markdown guides for an agent-led, read-only workflow. This repository
organizes checks into pass/fail guidance, severity and pillar mappings, adds
agent safety and output-handling rules, and uses its own reporting workflow.
These are project-level descriptions, not a claim that every individual
check or sentence originated upstream.

